  "description": "Broken Graffiti font is a chunky, caps-only display typeface that shouts with comic-book swagger and street-art attitude. Its forms are wide and muscular, built from thick sans-serif strokes that snap into angular breaks and split joints, giving each letter a chipped, “cracked wall” texture. Bowls are squashed and square-shouldered, counters stay open for legibility at large sizes, and crossbars kick upward with a playful bounce that injects motion into every word. A bold outer stroke invites layered color, sticker effects, and easy outlining; the compact width and tight default spacing create dense, punchy headlines. The voice is brash, friendly, and a little mischievous—perfect for hip-hop posters, streetwear tags, gaming titles, YouTube thumbnails, snack or toy packaging, and any branding that wants to read loud and fast. Pair the Broken Graffiti font with a clean grotesk for copy, lean into shadows and highlights for depth, and let its broken edges deliver instant urban energy.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Broken Graffiti font is a chunky, caps-only display typeface that shouts with comic-book swagger and street-art attitude.</strong> Its forms are wide and muscular, built from thick sans-serif strokes that snap into angular breaks and split joints, giving each letter a chipped, “cracked wall” texture. Bowls are squashed and square-shouldered, counters stay open for legibility at large sizes, and crossbars kick upward with a playful bounce that injects motion into every word. A bold outer stroke invites layered color, sticker effects, and easy outlining; the compact width and tight default spacing create dense, punchy headlines. The voice is brash, friendly, and a little mischievous—perfect for hip-hop posters, streetwear tags, gaming titles, YouTube thumbnails, snack or toy packaging, and any branding that wants to read loud and fast. Pair the&nbsp;<strong>Broken Graffiti font</strong>&nbsp;with a clean grotesk for copy, lean into shadows and highlights for depth, and let its broken edges deliver instant urban energy.</p>",
